  "narrative": "The new feature_002 follow-up evidence strongly supports treating feature_002=1 as a robust dataset-internal association with higher outcome_001 values, meaning weaker composite dependency relative to feature_002=0. All due feature_002 subgroup estimates are signed positive and far exceed the 0.15-unit threshold, and all lower confidence bounds are well above threshold. H71 within feature_037=0 is +0.822 with 95% CI +0.761 to +0.882 (R51). H72 within feature_010=0 is +0.780 with CI +0.719 to +0.841 (R52). Most importantly, H73 within the joint feature_037=0 and feature_010=0 baseline is +0.784 with CI +0.736 to +0.833 (R53), which argues that the feature_002 association is not simply an artifact of overlap with the accepted feature_037 or feature_010 axes. H74 and H75 remain large within feature_037=1 and feature_010=1, +0.845 and +0.990 respectively (R54, R55), so conditioning on the positive strata does not eliminate the signal. Across clinical robustness strata, H76-H79 also support stability: low/high natural-log PFS gives +0.679/+0.933 and low/high feature_019 gives +0.862/+0.776 (R56-R59). Across feature_038 tails, H80 and H81 give +0.774 and +0.719 with lower bounds +0.593 and +0.561 (R60, R61), making simple dependence on feature_038 biology less likely. Some numerical variation across strata is expected due to smaller cells and possible composition/effect-modification differences, but no stratum shows reversal or meaningful attenuation near threshold. I therefore accept H71-H81 as exact dataset-internal subgroup claims and close them as exact comparisons. The broader H70 main feature_002 claim remains accepted and active pending independent validation. I request validation of H70 rather than a selected subgroup because it is the central feature_002 claim and validation would best assess whether the large reversed signal is reproducible in the independent samples. The new categorical screen H83 is unsupported: feature_059 level_003 versus level_001 in the claimed negative direction gives signed estimate -0.046, CI -0.119 to +0.028 (R62). That is opposite to the claimed direction, small, and compatible with no association, so reject and close. This remains dataset association evidence only, not causal or generalizable mechanistic evidence.",
