lit by feature_002 status. These refine the accepted feature_010 = 0 feature_063 signal and test whether it is uniform or residual-context specific. If accepted, the feature_063 context map can be tightened; if not, the feature_010 = 0 feature_063 effect should remain reported only as an aggregate discovery-only association. The single most informative analysis overall would be independent external validation of the main axes and the feature_063 feature_010 = 0 contrast, but validation capacity is exhausted. All conclusions remain noncausal and internal to this dataset.",
